      "corroboration": "Not resolvable from installed products. Surfshark's provider ships the exception with a 10.15 minimum, PureVPN's two carry keychain-access-groups instead, and Tailscale's carries neither at a 12.4 minimum - support ranges far wider than this project's, so none of them isolates macOS 15.0 behaviour. See rule K3 productEvidenceIsNotProof.",
